{"exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"x":-79,"noOut":false,"img":"chara015_0","trans":true,"noIn":false,"y":-379,"alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"x":-79,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"img":"chara015_0","trans":true,"noIn":false,"y":-379,"alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]你们说……制出来的药很奇怪……？连续喝了几瓶之后，伤势没怎么好转，自己却上吐下泻？[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","scaleX":1,"nonStandBright":false,"mirrow":false,"x":-79,"noOut":false,"transTime":0,"img":"chara015_0","timeBak":300,"trans":false,"noIn":false,"y":-379,"alpha":1}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]……原来如此。我需要向你说明一点，药物并不是完全无害的！即便调配时将毒性压到几乎不用计量，连续使用的也依然会让身体吃不消……[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]当毒性超过100时，必须停止继续使用药物，否则会导致严重的副作用……在战斗中遭遇这种事非常危险，一定要记住这点。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]我对你们所制造的药水也不能完全放心……能给我看一下样品吗？若是被用在错误的地方，草药们会很伤心的。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}],"des":"改进配方01 是药三分毒","script":"sub_0_02_1"}